## Methodology summary

The valuation combines a discounted cash flow model and peer multiple analysis. The DCF uses unlevered free cash flow, a bottom-up beta, WACC, terminal growth and sensitivity analysis. The peer valuation focuses primarily on franchise-heavy restaurant peers to better match McDonald's rent-and-royalty business model.

## Data note

The report is based on public information and selected market data available at the time of preparation. Raw third-party market data is not redistributed in this repository.
